---
{#- Affiliation (Doc 05: verify affiliation, view letters; Q16: issuing body and letter date; Doc 06 Q24:
    every letter has a text summary). Wording and documents wait for the Director (OD-08). #}
<h1>Affiliation &amp; approvals</h1>
{% include "partials/about-nav.njk" %}
<div class="prose">
  {%- if affiliations.length %}
  <ul class="affiliation-list">
    {%- for a in affiliations %}
    <li>
      <h2 class="h3">{{ a.body }}</h2>
      <p>{{ a.what }}. Letter dated <time datetime="{{ a.letter_date | isoDate }}">{{ a.letter_date | displayDate }}</time>.</p>
      <p>{{ a.summary }}</p>
      {%- if a.file %}<p><a href="{{ a.file }}">View the letter <span class="small">({{ a.file | fileSize }})</span></a></p>{% endif %}
    </li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
  {%- else %}
  <p class="lead">This page will list each affiliation and approval with the body that issued it, the date of its letter, a short summary and a copy of the letter.</p>
  <p>{% tbc "affiliating university, approving bodies and their letters", "OD-08" %}</p>
  {%- endif %}
  <p>To check an affiliation before you apply, ask the admissions office to show you the original letter. <a href="/contact/">Contact admissions</a>.</p>
</div>
